    Consecutive frames must show waits or single orthogonal steps, no
    overlapping cells, no in-tick swaps, and each frame's ``moved`` list must
    name exactly the robots whose position changed. Mileage is reconstructable
    from the replay as well: a robot's distance grows by exactly one per tick
    frame it appears in ``moved``.
